    <sys:String x:Key="SteamInitCachePrompt_Title">Create Steam update cache?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="SteamInitCachePrompt_Message" xml:space="preserve">
        Aniki Helper can display a notification when a game receives a new update via Steam.

        To work correctly, the plugin must first scan your library and save the currently installed version of each game into a cache.

        This cache allows future updates to be detected correctly and helps avoid false notifications when browsing your games for the first time.
        For large libraries, this process may take some time.

        If you do not create the cache now, it will be built gradually as you browse your games, which may cause incorrect notifications at the beginning.

        You can recreate or delete this cache at any time from the plugin settings in Desktop mode.

        Would you like to create the cache now?
    </sys:String>



